{
"file": 74,
"paths": [
"d007/d000/f317"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "6ce56711",
"en_raw": "...Murase"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "6213df73",
"en_raw": "You think it's normal"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "fc3eeefe",
"en_raw": "for Yuasa and them to push you around"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "e2518ba1",
"en_raw": "whenever they want, right?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "761197e2",
"en_raw": "But a loser has no real reason"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "fa1128d0",
"en_raw": "to throw his weight around"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "afc6b188",
"en_raw": "I'm not treated"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "3ca923b4",
"en_raw": "that badly..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "8ea9c075",
"en_raw": "Wrong!"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "13b14577",
"en_raw": "Those guys don't"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "0909307e",
"en_raw": "understand anything"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "f4912452",
"en_raw": "Who has what rights"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "e790bf12",
"en_raw": "and how that power"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "45d5fd0f",
"en_raw": "should be used"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "2addd26c",
"en_raw": "Honestly"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "c68a4108",
"en_raw": "They don't understand a thing"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "1828e899",
"en_raw": "Nothing..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "c53530c8",
"en_raw": "Hey, Murase"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "ce85abec",
"en_raw": "You actually"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "49d0dde0",
"en_raw": "talk to Takayuki Nishi quite a bit"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "df7342b2",
"en_raw": "In gym class"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "3fa87243",
"en_raw": "I get paired with him"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "2f02ba7f",
"en_raw": "and he doesn't say a word"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "8adc32b4",
"en_raw": "...Even though he chatters away to girls"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "4168657a",
"en_raw": "So when I did a handstand"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "9fa01b5d",
"en_raw": "and hit his face with my shoe"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "a4fb84b3",
"en_raw": "before I could apologize"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "cadb7234",
"en_raw": "what do you think he said?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "8ba41ebf",
"en_raw": "...'Oh, it's fine'"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "9991e8e1",
"en_raw": "That's what he said!"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "70eb92a7",
"en_raw": "Hey, why does that guy"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "6046593c",
"en_raw": "have such a big attitude?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "fe99492e",
"en_raw": "With a look like"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "0d32cc42",
"en_raw": "'I'm the only adult here'"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "443ef7cb",
"en_raw": "I hate everything about him"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "60c1db95",
"en_raw": "You think so too, Murase, right?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "c53530c8",
"en_raw": "Hey, Murase"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "a67bb558",
"en_raw": "Yamazaki is really an idiot"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "09f5a5ed",
"en_raw": "Competing with Nishi"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "b039c1e5",
"en_raw": "and acting all grown-up"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "3c233ef4",
"en_raw": "He's really a pitiful guy..."
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "246e995a",
"en_raw": "Yamazaki should"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "0006297e",
"en_raw": "just hit him and be done with it"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "51148380",
"en_raw": "unless he doesn't want to shorten"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "63a8413a",
"en_raw": "his life from too much noradrenaline"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "280f2b49",
"en_raw": "Nishi probably"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "1ed9d722",
"en_raw": "is strong in fights too"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "6fc36085",
"en_raw": "...Huh"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "39dbcd84",
"en_raw": "But he'd lose to me"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "6114aa73",
"en_raw": "Next time I'll show only you,"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "db58fdd5",
"en_raw": "Murase"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "90bd4dde",
"en_raw": "my secret weapon..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "c53530c8",
"en_raw": "Hey, Murase"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "bb0f30da",
"en_raw": "You should stop talking"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "51bb3283",
"en_raw": "with Sanjo and her kind"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "9926ff93",
"en_raw": "I think I understand"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "c43ba44a",
"en_raw": "you, but"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "a4248561",
"en_raw": "when it comes to girls"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "54267d6c",
"en_raw": "it's not great"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "91ac201a",
"en_raw": "...Why?"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "2016e7b1",
"en_raw": "It'd be pitiful for Kurumi Shiina"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "d027d8e6",
"en_raw": "If you don't pity her"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "5061fef2",
"en_raw": "you shouldn't associate with her"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "6331c90c",
"en_raw": "and if you do pity her"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "789f7fb7",
"en_raw": "you'd better not talk to Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "69640de9",
"en_raw": "even if she"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "a369a630",
"en_raw": "talks to you first"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "180ef06b",
"en_raw": "To protect someone important"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "88c49a98",
"en_raw": "sometimes you have to ignore people"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "bc5e85fa",
"en_raw": "Sure, for a personality like yours"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "6b027beb",
"en_raw": "it takes a bit of courage"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "546f9714",
"en_raw": "Murase is"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "9e0345a4",
"en_raw": "a little too nice"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "82d1c4f4",
"en_raw": "That Shinta Segawa"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "8e637a9d",
"en_raw": "is still just playing games?"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "7873ad9e",
"en_raw": "Still such a kid"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "12e5f61c",
"en_raw": "That's why"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "e8bca70a",
"en_raw": "Yuasa and them look down on him"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "4d1f1e99",
"en_raw": "Don't you think so, Murase?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "ad84bf12",
"en_raw": "I don't, really..."
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "21a58368",
"en_raw": "Sometimes I get embarrassed"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "22efa948",
"en_raw": "about being friends with him"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "b5596c9d",
"en_raw": "Murase"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "dbfbfc7d",
"en_raw": "I think we'll get along well"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "2fa17e55",
"en_raw": "Wait"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "6c591e9b",
"en_raw": "We're not done talking"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "4164ff0b",
"en_raw": "Even if you and I are friends"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "b0b1f92a",
"en_raw": "you'd better"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "d3913b55",
"en_raw": "tone that attitude down a bit"
}
]
}